<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Scientific-Atlanta raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Scientific-Atlanta raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette analyst Eric Buck on Friday said he raised his rating for Scientific-Atlanta Inc to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Buck told Reuters he upgraded the rating because of the company's second-quarter results, especially orders, reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The orders were much better than expected,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Atlanta-based communications equipment and cable TV electronics maker were up 1-1/2 to 18-1/8 in heavy mid-afternoon trade.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
